---
description: WivWav workflow and context rules
alwaysApply: true
---

WivWav is a pnpm/Turborepo TypeScript monorepo for wheelchair-accessible vehicle listings.
Follow `AGENTS.md`; use `.claude/core.md` for architecture and conventions.
Search with `rg`; read narrow ranges; keep edits issue-scoped.

Never work directly on `main`.
Use strict TypeScript; no `any`.
NodeNext local imports use `.js`; Bundler source imports in `apps/web`, `apps/ops`, and `packages/charts` are extensionless.
Web calls APIs; web never reads the database directly.
Keep swappable dependencies behind interfaces.
For user-facing web changes, read `docs/BRAND.md`; meet WCAG 2.1 AA.
Iteration: `pnpm check:affected`.
Before finish: `pnpm typecheck && pnpm lint && pnpm build && pnpm test`.
